#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:2
msgid "AMDGPU Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:4
msgid "Clang supports OpenCL, HIP and OpenMP on AMD GPU targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:6
msgid "Predefined Macros"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Macro"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__AMDGPU__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Indicates that the code is being compiled for an AMD GPU."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__AMDGCN__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if the GPU target is AMDGCN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__R600__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if the GPU target is R600."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__<ArchName>__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid ""
"Defined with the name of the architecture (e.g., `__gfx906__` for the gfx906 "
"architecture)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__<GFXN>__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid ""
"Defines the GFX family (e.g., for gfx906, this macro would be `__GFX9__`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__amdgcn_processor__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined with the processor name as a string (e.g., `\"gfx906\"`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__amdgcn_target_id__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined with the target ID as a string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__amdgcn_feature_<feature-name>__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid ""
"Defined for each supported target feature. The value is 1 if the feature is "
"enabled and 0 if it is disabled. Allowed feature names are sramecc and xnack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__AMDGCN_CUMODE__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid ""
"Defined as 1 if the CU mode is enabled and 0 if the WGP mode is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__AMDGCN_UNSAFE_FP_ATOMICS__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if unsafe floating-point atomics are allowed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__HAS_FMAF__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if FMAF instruction is available (deprecated)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__HAS_LDEXPF__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if LDEXPF instruction is available (deprecated)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "`__HAS_FP64__`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:0
msgid "Defined if FP64 instruction is available (deprecated)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:24
msgid ""
"Please note that the specific architecture and feature names will vary "
"depending on the GPU. Also, some macros are deprecated and may be removed in "
"future releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:26
msgid "Target-Specific Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:28
msgid ""
"Clang exposes AMDGPU hardware intrinsics as target-specific builtins with "
"the `__builtin_amdgcn_` prefix. These are documented in {doc}"
"`AMDGPUBuiltinReference`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:31
msgid "Target-Specific Types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:33
msgid "Named Workgroup Barrier Type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:35
msgid ""
"The `__amdgpu_named_workgroup_barrier_t` type is used to represent the "
"GFX12.5 named barriers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:37
msgid ""
"This type is subject to certain restrictions when used to declare non-static "
"fields of classes. See the {ref}`named barrier "
"wrappers<namedbarrierwrappers>` section below for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:40
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:57
msgid "Named Barrier Wrappers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:59
msgid ""
"A \"named barrier wrapper\" is a class that contains exactly one non-static "
"field of one of the following types:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:62
msgid "`__amdgpu_named_workgroup_barrier_t`, or an array thereof."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:63
msgid "Another named barrier wrapper, or an array thereof."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:65
msgid ""
"In C++, a class that inherits from a named barrier wrapper is also "
"considered a named barrier wrapper, and all named barrier wrappers must be "
"standard-layout types (see `std::is_standard_layout`). This means that named "
"barrier wrappers:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:69
msgid ""
"May not have a virtual table: they cannot declare or inherit any virtual "
"functions, or inherit from a virtual base class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUSupport.md:71
msgid ""
"May not have any extra fields, either declared by the class or inherited "
"from a base class."
msgstr ""
